+## Usage reporting
+
+- When a turn runs multiple provider calls — an initial call plus one or more tool rounds — `afterModelResponse` receives usage that covers every call in the turn, not only the last one, so a deployer billing or auditing from this hook counts every token the turn consumed ([validated by: sums usage across all rounds and passes the total to the hook for a two-round tool turn](../../src/orchestration/chatOrchestrator.acceptance.test.ts#L41)).
+
 ## Measured semantics — out of scope
 
 These two properties of `src/orchestration/chatOrchestrator.ts` are recorded so the hook features that follow specify against real behaviour. This issue changes none of them; each is a separate, out-of-scope change owned by no issue in this epic.
